        <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="http://www.atb-bremen.de/ontologies/generic-context-model/ResourceInformation"/>
        <skos:definition>Product is a material artifact that describes the (material) good that is being manufactured as an outcome of a production process.</skos:definition>
